    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, i guess... but \"letting go\" feels impossible when i still have to wake up every morning and do the same stuff. it's exhausting. it's like i'm stuck in a loop. sometimes i just wish i could find some kind of actual peace. like, a way to just make the noise and the emptiness stop for good. is that even a thing? can you actually find stillness?",
